#~| "\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Van_der_Waals_radius\">Van der Waals "
#~| "radius</a>.<br><br><b>Getting more molecules</b><br>It's easy to obtain "
#~| "more molecules for this viewer, as it supports various common file "
#~| "formats. Here's a list of good public databanks:<ul><li><a href=\"http://"
#~| "www.rcsb.org/pdb\">The Protein Data Bank (PDB)</a> <i>(For starters, we "
